    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112797" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φώγω</span></b> , imperat. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῶγε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epich.
					151
				</span></i>
			; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῴζω</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Stratt.
				65
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				2.56
			</span></i>; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωγνύω</span></b> 
			(Valck. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωγύνω</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>; inf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωγνύναι</span> (as if fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φώγνυμι</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				962.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				803.32
			</span></i> (so in 
				Pass.
			
			3sg.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φώγνυται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.68
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				4.64
			</span></i>): aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφωξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.78
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				607
			</span></i>, but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφωσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.113
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dieuch.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				4.7.1
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφώχθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.97
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.90
			</span></i>: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέφωγμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					68
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέφωσμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					7.80
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.64
			</span></i>, Iatrocl. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.647c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				6.6.2
			</span></i>:—<i>roast, toast, parch,</i> ll.cc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχάδες πεφωγμέναι</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεφρυγμέναι</span>
			) Pherecr.l.c. (Cf. ONorse <i>baka,</i> Engl.
		<i>bake.</i>)</div>
